  "solution": "<div class=\"with-figure\"><div>Gọi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>I</mi></semantics></math> là trung điểm của <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>H</mi></semantics></math> là hình chiếu của <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>A</mi></semantics></math> trên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>I</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>⊥</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>I</mi></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>⊥</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi><mo>⇒</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>⊥</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>I</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>⇒</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>⊥</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>I</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Mặt khác <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>I</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>∩</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>I</mi></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>H</mi><mo>⊥</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>I</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Nên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>H</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><msqrt><mn>57</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>12</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>.<br><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>△</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> đều cạnh <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>⇒</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Xét tam giác <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>I</mi></mrow></semantics></math> vuông tại <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>A</mi></semantics></math>, ta có\n\t\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>A</mi><msup><mi>H</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>A</mi><msup><mi>I</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>144</mn><mrow><mn>57</mn><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>4</mn><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>68</mn><mrow><mn>57</mn><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>⇒</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><msqrt><mn>57</mn></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>17</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\t\tVậy <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>′</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><msqrt><mn>57</mn></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>17</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><msqrt><mn>171</mn></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mn>8</mn><msqrt><mn>17</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>.</div><div class=\"side-figure\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/6d3cc3df936f76c9abae26e5138e170dbf83d2e11941bd0649ec85a62a4ac1e4.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure></div></div>",
